From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:38:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] include: add IGraphicsEffectD2D1Interop

What a Windows.Graphics.Effects effect is in terms of a Direct2D effect: its
CLSID, its properties by index, how named properties map onto them, and its
sources.  As in the Windows SDK's windows.graphics.effects.interop.h.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit c8d9f9a2cf889d94c9e16914565018278ff4c8ac)

diff --git a/include/Makefile.in b/include/Makefile.in
index 99f0eabfb2a..4b8e9a38f11 100644
--- a/include/Makefile.in
+++ b/include/Makefile.in
@@ -1056,6 +1056,7 @@ SOURCES = \
 	windows.graphics.directx.idl \
 	windows.graphics.display.idl \
 	windows.graphics.effects.idl \
+	windows.graphics.effects.interop.idl \
 	windows.graphics.holographic.idl \
 	windows.graphics.idl \
 	windows.graphics.imaging.idl \
diff --git a/include/windows.graphics.effects.interop.idl b/include/windows.graphics.effects.interop.idl
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..c96313c8fa6
--- /dev/null
+++ b/include/windows.graphics.effects.interop.idl
@@ -0,0 +1,63 @@
